#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:223
#: 3a29eb3da59849e9b6d91b3d65877640
msgid ""
"Navigation commands are used to control the movement of the vehicle, "
"including takeoff, moving to and around waypoints, and landing."
msgstr "导航指令用于控制飞行器的运动，包括起飞、飞往和围绕航点移动以及降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:226
#: b6f1ca1162424349a3bc3d35bfeb664a
msgid ""
"NAV commands have the highest priority. Any DO\\_ and CONDITION\\_ commands "
"that have not executed when a NAV command is loaded are skipped (for "
"example, if a waypoint completes and the NAV command for another waypoint is"
" loaded, and unexecuted DO/CONDITION commands associated with the first "
"waypoint are dropped."
msgstr ""
"NAV 指令具有最高优先级。当 NAV 指令加载时，尚未执行的 DO\\_ 和 CONDITION\\_ "
"指令将被跳过（例如，如果一个航点完成并加载了另一个航点的 NAV 指令，与第一个航点关联的未执行 DO/CONDITION 指令将被丢弃）。"

