#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:398
#: af4eb740668b4841955d93004993e45f
msgid "MAV_CMD_NAV_LOITER_UNLIM"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_NAV_LOITER_UNLIM"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:402
#: 0cee0f6a073540b6ac79901cc9fcc12f
msgid "Loiter at the specified location for an unlimited amount of time."
msgstr "在指定位置无限期悬停。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:406
#: 4e1a5b3cb9de4f3cb93d200c8a65bc40
msgid ""
"Fly to the specified location and then loiter there indefinitely — where "
"loiter means \"wait in place\" (rather than \"circle\"). If zero is "
"specified for a latitude/longitude/altitude parameter then the current "
"location value for the parameter will be used."
msgstr ""
"飞往指定位置并在该处无限期悬停——此处悬停指「在原地等待」（而非「绕圈飞行」）。如果纬度/经度/高度参数中任一指定为零，则使用该参数的当前位置值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:411
#: 50c4492252d44c06ac853f7c12118ff0
msgid ""
"The mission will not proceed past this command while in AUTO mode. In order "
"to break out of this command you need to change the mode (i.e. to MANUAL). "
"If there are subsequent commands then you can continue the mission at the "
"next command, if the Copter ``MIS_RESTART`` parameter is set to resume, by "
"switching back to AUTO mode (otherwise the mission will restart)."
msgstr ""
"在 AUTO 模式下，任务不会跳过此指令继续执行。要退出此指令，需要切换飞行模式（例如切换到 MANUAL 模式）。如果后续还有其他指令，可将飞行器的 "
"``MIS_RESTART`` 参数设置为恢复模式，然后切换回 AUTO 模式以从下一条指令继续任务（否则任务将从头开始）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:472
#: 3c59c8174e4f4295b09c92fbb443096a
msgid "Copter: Mission Planner Settings for LOITER_UNLIM command"
msgstr "Copter：LOITER_UNLIM 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:482
#: 982629aa30ab4c4aa86cf91d3f0ebfea
msgid "MAV_CMD_NAV_LOITER_TURNS"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_NAV_LOITER_TURNS"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:489
#: 6851e138483c440d9ca0bd50deed39bf
msgid ""
"Loiter (circle) the specified location for at least the specified number of "
"complete turns, and then proceed to the next command upon intersection of "
"the course to it with the circle's perimeter. If zero is specified for a "
"latitude/longitude/altitude parameter then the current location value for "
"the parameter will be used. Fractional turns between 0 and 1 are supported, "
"while turns greater than 1 must be integers."
msgstr ""
"在指定位置盘旋（绕圈）至少指定的完整圈数，然后在飞行路线与圆弧相交时继续执行下一条指令。如果纬度/经度/高度参数中任一指定为零，则使用该参数的当前位置值。支持"
" 0 到 1 之间的小数圈数，大于 1 的圈数必须为整数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:494
#: 82ae8db38529443b88cebf5731f6ce6c
msgid ""
"The radius of the circle is controlled by the command parameter. A radius of"
" 0 will result in the copter loitering at the location and pirouetting the "
"specified number of turns. Negative radius values result in counter-"
"clockwise turns instead of clockwise turns. Radius values over 255 meters "
"will be rounded down to the nearest 10 meter mark."
msgstr ""
"圆圈半径由指令参数控制。半径为 0 时，飞行器将在原地悬停并原地旋转指定圈数。负半径值将使飞行器逆时针转圈而非顺时针。超过 255 "
"米的半径值将向下取整到最近的 10 米整数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:497
#: 1b40937086c04bfd9991b4b49c24e0e7
msgid ""
"This is the command equivalent of the :ref:`Circle flight mode "
"<copter:circle-mode>`."
msgstr "此指令等同于 :ref:`Circle 飞行模式 <copter:circle-mode>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:553
#: 63a593c8b2984492aa7951634a0f4e0a
msgid "Copter: Mission Planner Settings for LOITER_TURNS command"
msgstr "Copter：LOITER_TURNS 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:563
#: 6c276945bbb7466090868fe95e7cad40
msgid "MAV_CMD_NAV_LOITER_TIME"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_NAV_LOITER_TIME"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:565
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1193
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1253
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1759
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2209
#: 4b26197da6984be98873d03f659b362a 696e065ff5e54500ad9e90686109d503
#: b38b802f640744e9882794c3ebf886ab b5ccf4dd17e945d0bfd19b43a2f0e02a
#: bdcf1ef11df6400290e0f4ff2388c192
msgid "Supported by: Copter, Plane, Rover."
msgstr "支持的飞行器：Copter、Plane、Rover。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:568
#: fd56e3a9118043a794ea403926139a0b
msgid ""
"Fly/Drive to the specified location and then loiter there for the specified "
"number of seconds — where loiter means \"wait in place\" (rather than "
"\"circle\"). The timer starts when the waypoint is reached; when it expires "
"the waypoint is complete. If zero is specified for a "
"latitude/longitude/altitude parameter then the current location value for "
"the parameter will be used."
msgstr ""
"飞往/驶往指定位置，然后在该处悬停指定秒数——此处悬停指「在原地等待」（而非「绕圈飞行」）。计时器在到达航点时开始；到期后航点完成。如果纬度/经度/高度参数中任一指定为零，则使用该参数的当前位置值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:575
#: 5bae4bb842b44310b17da862e91d9b45
msgid ""
"This is the mission equivalent of the :ref:`Loiter flight mode "
"<copter:loiter-mode>` or :ref:`Hold mode <rover:hold-mode>`."
msgstr ""
"此指令等同于任务中的 :ref:`Loiter 飞行模式 <copter:loiter-mode>` 或 :ref:`Hold 模式 "
"<rover:hold-mode>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:631
#: bbd7cc7c4a864b5a9533ca9836a474b9
msgid "Copter: Mission Planner Settings for LOITER_TIME command"
msgstr "Copter：LOITER_TIME 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:640
#: a62049fc7d3844a9a8a6e64116425dca
msgid "MAV_CMD_NAV_RETURN_TO_LAUNCH"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_NAV_RETURN_TO_LAUNCH"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:644
#: ad5b7813779c4203b0e8909513b9a0cb
msgid ""
"Return to the *home location* or the nearest `Rally Point <common-rally-"
"points>`__, if closer. The home location is where the vehicle was last armed"
" (or when it first gets GPS lock after arming if the vehicle configuration "
"allows this)."
msgstr ""
"返回 *Home 位置*，或返回最近的 `集结点 <common-rally-points>`__ （如果更近）。Home "
"位置是飞行器最后一次解锁的位置（如果飞行器配置允许，则为解锁后首次获得 GPS 锁定的位置）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:653
#: a30bcecb64b74758a681fc324f2b5a9a
msgid "Copter"
msgstr "Copter"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:655
#: 58ce43c357724c2cbd7038e898bda366
msgid ""
"Return to the *home location* (or the nearest :ref:`Rally Point <common-"
"rally-points>` if closer) and then land. The home location is where the "
"vehicle was last armed (or when it first gets GPS lock after arming if the "
"vehicle configuration allows this)."
msgstr ""
"返回 *Home 位置*（或最近的 :ref:`集结点 <common-rally-points>`，如果更近），然后降落。Home "
"位置是飞行器最后一次解锁的位置（如果飞行器配置允许，则为解锁后首次获得 GPS 锁定的位置）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:659
#: 70f926754035486bbe2717e3f65a3c9d
msgid ""
"This is the mission equivalent of the :ref:`RTL flight mode <copter:rtl-"
"mode>`.  The vehicle will first climb to the :ref:`RTL_ALT <copter:RTL_ALT>`"
" parameter's specified altitude (default is 15m) before returning home."
msgstr ""
"此指令等同于 :ref:`RTL 飞行模式 <copter:rtl-mode>`。飞行器将先爬升至 :ref:`RTL_ALT "
"<copter:RTL_ALT>` 参数指定的高度（默认为 15m），然后返回 Home。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:664
#: e97b64d6e109440fb728165b6edaddcb
msgid ""
"This command takes no parameters and generally should be the last command in"
" the mission."
msgstr "此指令不需要任何参数，通常应作为任务的最后一条指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:722
#: 9a243ea2695f49689b62a1557667974b
msgid "Copter: Mission PlannerSettings for RETURN_TO_LAUNCH command"
msgstr "Copter：RETURN_TO_LAUNCH 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:735
#: ad037aef5c0749aab2fba49789d0b2bd
msgid "MAV_CMD_NAV_LAND"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_NAV_LAND"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:741
#: cd0ba03a2ac143259c887907de48bde9
msgid ""
"The copter will land at its current location or proceed at current altitude "
"to the lat/lon coordinates provided (if non-zero) and land.  This is the "
"mission equivalent of the :ref:`LAND flight mode <copter:land-mode>`."
msgstr ""
"飞行器将在当前位置降落，或以当前高度飞往指定的经纬度坐标（如果非零）并降落。此指令等同于 :ref:`LAND 飞行模式 <copter:land-"
"mode>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:745
#: 7ee8c0b3f9e7481a98a89ea132c2df65
msgid ""
"The motors will not stop on their own: you must exit AUTO mode to cut the "
"engines."
msgstr "电机不会自动停止：必须退出 AUTO 模式才能关闭电机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:803
#: 106763251ebe4d4dbe286d7c0e086df7
msgid "Copter: Mission Planner Settings for LAND command"
msgstr "Copter：LAND 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:819
#: d175049f60ac4e5abdf91cc39de7499b
msgid "MAV_CMD_NAV_SPLINE_WAYPOINT"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_NAV_SPLINE_WAYPOINT"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:821
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:902
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1506
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2783
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2850
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2916
#: 38bff64ac57847ff9baa4d3ccb2ebc5e 52ddc4128876488491abec2151be1f13
#: 5403c68d177d41808cd25917a6fc9692 6e98b8207a6a411493a6af0488347479
#: aa0962b6ceab4f5eb617bb994478e402 f0e44d2fc93546ca939f8ab9bc6b3fd7
msgid "Supported by: Copter (not Plane or Rover)."
msgstr "支持的飞行器：Copter（不含 Plane 或 Rover）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:823
#: 8cb51f5da10d479b900eec66f672a476
msgid ""
"Fly to the target location using a `Spline path "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spline_%28mathematics%29>`__, then wait "
"(hover) for a specified time before proceeding to the next command."
msgstr ""
"使用 `样条曲线路径 <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spline_%28mathematics%29>`__ "
"飞往目标位置，然后等待（悬停）指定时间后继续执行下一条指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:826
#: b7205191a8fc4711a077a416f805f449
msgid ""
"The Spline commands take all the same arguments are regular waypoints (lat, "
"lon, alt, delay) but when executed the vehicle will fly smooth paths (both "
"vertically and horizontally) instead of straight lines. Spline waypoints can"
" be mixed with regular straight-line waypoints as shown in the screenshot "
"below."
msgstr ""
"样条指令与普通航点使用相同的参数（纬度、经度、高度、延迟），但执行时飞行器将沿平滑路径飞行（垂直和水平方向均如此），而非沿直线飞行。样条航点可与普通直线航点混用，如下方截图所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:884
#: 56258a1c98614cd4a2939f7544dd1fa2
msgid "Copter: Mission Planner Settings for SPLINE_WAYPOINT command"
msgstr "Copter：SPLINE_WAYPOINT 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:886
#: 6799642e34004222833fec85b5fd5519
msgid "The Mission Planner screenshot shows the path the vehicle will take."
msgstr "Mission Planner 截图显示了飞行器将要飞行的路径。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:888
#: 4b45a1d0194142deb757b8fc2a17e3db
msgid ""
"The 1 second delay at the end of Waypoint #1 causes the vehicle to stop so "
"Spline command #2 begins by taking a sharp 90degree turn"
msgstr "航点 #1 末尾的 1 秒延迟导致飞行器停止，因此样条指令 #2 从急转 90 度开始"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:890
#: fbf1a514b8a040a28bd4de95f6c3a333
msgid ""
"The direction of travel as the vehicle passes through Spline Waypoint #3 is "
"parallel to an imaginary line drawn between waypoints #2 and #4"
msgstr "飞行器经过样条航点 #3 时的飞行方向与航点 #2 和 #4 之间的假想连线平行"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:892
#: 03c00b343b404797bf78c926e6b7fc4d
msgid ""
"Waypoint #5 is a straight line so the vehicle lines itself up to point "
"towards waypoint #5 even before reaching waypoint #4."
msgstr "航点 #5 是直线，因此飞行器在到达航点 #4 之前就已经开始朝向航点 #5 方向对齐。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:900
#: eaf49c678c954f9d80d4c0cba4cb497b
msgid "MAV_CMD_NAV_GUIDED_ENABLE"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_NAV_GUIDED_ENABLE"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:904
#: 4570a9e8103b4416a1a46671954b5213
msgid ""
"Enable ``GUIDED`` mode to hand over control to an external "
"controller/:ref:`common-companion-computers`. ee :ref:`Guided Mode "
"<copter:ac2_guidedmode>` for more information. The :ref:`common-companion-"
"computers`  would then send MAVLink commands to control the vehicle."
msgstr ""
"启用 ``GUIDED`` 模式，将控制权移交给外部控制器/:ref:`common-companion-computers`。详情请参阅 "
":ref:`Guided 模式 <copter:ac2_guidedmode>`。:ref:`common-companion-computers` "
"随后将发送 MAVLink 指令来控制飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:906
#: 93722b55636643e183ed1b3ca5db334c
msgid ""
"See also :ref:`MAV_CMD_DO_GUIDED_LIMITS <mav_cmd_do_guided_limits>` for "
"information on how to apply time, altitude and distance limits on the "
"external control."
msgstr ""
"另请参阅 :ref:`MAV_CMD_DO_GUIDED_LIMITS "
"<mav_cmd_do_guided_limits>`，了解如何对外部控制设置时间、高度和距离限制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:972
#: 2f35b2eb8ed74679af88936850b99042
msgid "MAV_CMD_NAV_DELAY"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_NAV_DELAY"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:974
#: 0f7ae48b11664d0b9a8bb049446112c8
msgid "Supported by: Copter, Rover, Plane."
msgstr "支持的飞行器：Copter、Rover、Plane。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:978
#: d522d99e287c45dba34a34fb9eb5251b
msgid ""
"After reaching this waypoint, delay the execution of the next mission "
"command until either the time in seconds has elapsed or the time entered(in "
"the future) is reached. Execution of the next mission item then occurs. For "
"Copters, they will loiter until then, and Rovers hold position."
msgstr ""
"到达此航点后，延迟执行下一条任务指令，直到经过指定秒数或到达指定时间（将来某时刻）。然后继续执行下一条任务项。Copter 在此期间悬停，Rover "
"保持位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1039
#: 8780142bb23a4a579696b9214d76a48a
msgid "MAV_CMD_NAV_PAYLOAD_PLACE"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_NAV_PAYLOAD_PLACE"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1041
#: 46dd01d748bf4a4e80b6cf4ec6a96d09
msgid "Supported by: Copter and Plane."
msgstr "支持的飞行器：Copter 和 Plane。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1045
#: 2bfe6c6c3f4844d5a62bf9e8d5a8f056
msgid ""
"After reaching this waypoint, the vehicle will descend up to the maximum "
"descent value. If the payload has not touched the ground before this limit "
"is reached, the vehicle will climb back up to the waypoint altitude and "
"continue to the next mission item. If it reaches the ground, it will "
"automatically release the gripper if enabled, and optionally wait a period, "
"re-grip, and ascend back to the waypoint altitude and continue the mission. "
"Numerous parameters that control the payload touch-down detection, wait "
"period, etc. are prefaced with ``PLDP_``."
msgstr ""
"到达此航点后，飞行器将下降至最大下降值。如果在到达此限制前负载未接触地面，飞行器将重新爬升至航点高度并继续执行下一条任务项。如果接触地面，将自动释放抓手（如果启用），可选择等待一段时间，然后重新抓取并爬升回航点高度继续任务。控制负载触地检测、等待时间等的众多参数均以"
" ``PLDP_`` 为前缀。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1048
#: 1e3c483fa25942f194a822d6c9b956fc
msgid "[wiki site=\"copter,plane\"] **Command parameters**"
msgstr "[wiki site=\"copter,plane\"] **指令参数**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1099
#: 84728174c6864caa8b2c21d098b45cd0
msgid "[/site]"
msgstr "[/site]"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1104
#: a98f214b844b44d3aecd1368107eca1b
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_JUMP"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_JUMP"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1108
#: 6b1f5e35ab6c466281ec29168bbeafd6
msgid ""
"Jump to the specified command in the mission list. The jump command can be "
"repeated either a specified number of times before continuing the mission, "
"or it can be repeated indefinitely."
msgstr "跳转到任务列表中指定的指令。跳转指令可以在继续任务前重复指定次数，也可以无限期重复。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1114
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1261
#: 0e4fa100d3e44748a73c5b3b524036dc ab0240cadd2d465fb63aefbf11195771
msgid ""
"Despite the name, this command is really a \"NAV\\_\" command rather than a "
"\"DO\\_\" command. Conditional commands like CONDITION_DELAY don't affect "
"DO_JUMP (it will always perform the jump as soon as it reaches the command)."
msgstr ""
"尽管名称如此，此指令实际上是 「NAV\\_」 指令而非 「DO\\_」 指令。CONDITION_DELAY 等条件指令不影响 "
"DO_JUMP（飞行器到达该指令时会立即执行跳转）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1121
#: 2b83f809f0794c978cd8cc6846a485a1
msgid ""
"There can be a maximum of 15 jump commands in a mission after which new "
"DO_JUMP commands are ignored."
msgstr "一次任务中最多可有 15 条跳转指令，超出后新的 DO_JUMP 指令将被忽略。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1183
#: 2403276475ee41609d8d1ad827b54471
msgid "Mission Planner Settings for DO_JUMP command"
msgstr "DO_JUMP 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1185
#: 28c0cffada1043c58c323113b960591d
msgid ""
"In the example above the vehicle would fly back-and-forth between waypoints "
"#1 and #2 a total of 3 times before flying on to waypoint #4."
msgstr "在上述示例中，飞行器将在航点 #1 和 #2 之间来回飞行共 3 次，然后继续飞往航点 #4。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1191
#: 32d85072a57844e0a455c4eb3d619f2f
msgid "MAV_CMD_JUMP_TAG"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_JUMP_TAG"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1195
#: 08faf8a7e6254d73b8cb3ef6bf1a21ef
msgid ""
"This is a location marker in the mission command sequence that can be used "
"as a \"jump to\" location for the "
":ref:`MAV_CMD_DO_JUMP_TAG<MAV_CMD_DO_JUMP_TAG>` command. The tag id in its "
"parameter field can be any arbitrary number between 1 and 65535."
msgstr ""
"这是任务指令序列中的位置标记，可作为 :ref:`MAV_CMD_DO_JUMP_TAG<MAV_CMD_DO_JUMP_TAG>` "
"指令的「跳转目标」位置。参数字段中的标签 ID 可以是 1 到 65535 之间的任意数字。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1251
#: 1dda03d085be4ff3afa8a98a5570dee0
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_JUMP_TAG"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_JUMP_TAG"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1255
#: f5aba9227ccc4ab3b754ef2d749a9f49
msgid ""
"Jump to the specified :ref:`MAV_CMD_JUMP_TAG<MAV_CMD_JUMP_TAG>` item in the "
"mission list. The jump tag command can be repeated, either a specified "
"number of times before continuing the mission, or it can be repeated "
"indefinitely."
msgstr ""
"跳转到任务列表中指定的 :ref:`MAV_CMD_JUMP_TAG<MAV_CMD_JUMP_TAG>` "
"项。跳转标签指令可以重复，在继续任务前重复指定次数，也可以无限期重复。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1268
#: a1c3d328bc2145799da74446f17d4c62
msgid ""
"There can be a maximum of 15 jump_tag commands in a mission after which new "
"DO_JUMP_TAG commands are ignored."
msgstr "一次任务中最多可有 15 条 jump_tag 指令，超出后新的 DO_JUMP_TAG 指令将被忽略。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1330
#: 4cfc6bd8d4824a4982d14200042420d3
msgid "Mission Planner Settings for DO_JUMP_TAG command"
msgstr "DO_JUMP_TAG 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1332
#: 0406a612dafe4232a041c225177fb2a8
msgid ""
"In the example above, the vehicle would fly back-and-forth between waypoints"
" #3 and #4 a total of 3 times before completing the mission. This is because"
" the DO_JUMP_TAG redirects the vehicle to JUMP_TAG #565 twice."
msgstr ""
"在上述示例中，飞行器将在航点 #3 和 #4 之间来回飞行共 3 次后完成任务。这是因为 DO_JUMP_TAG 将飞行器重定向到 JUMP_TAG "
"#565 两次。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1335
#: 0295da2f0d5d43baae2b58c65619cbf4
msgid "Conditional commands"
msgstr "条件指令"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1337
#: 502ed03f226d47e084740aa68b97495b
msgid ""
"Conditional commands control the execution of \\_DO\\_ commands. For "
"example, a conditional command can prevent DO commands from executing based "
"on a time delay, until the vehicle is at a certain altitude, or at a "
"specified distance from the next target position."
msgstr "条件指令控制 \\_DO\\_ 指令的执行。例如，条件指令可以根据时间延迟、直到飞行器到达特定高度或距下一目标位置特定距离来阻止 DO 指令执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1342
#: 23c09ea0ba74439eada866565fa1944a
msgid ""
"A conditional command may not be complete before reaching the next waypoint."
" In this case, any unexecuted \\_DO\\_ commands associated with the last "
"waypoint will be skipped."
msgstr "条件指令可能在到达下一个航点前尚未完成。在这种情况下，与上一个航点相关联的任何未执行的 \\_DO\\_ 指令将被跳过。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1349
#: f3aa97e5c7bd4baa88de514a15cb471b
msgid "MAV_CMD_CONDITION_DELAY"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_CONDITION_DELAY"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1353
#: bd5f6eb0e78549419544fc4eff8e25ea
msgid ""
"After reaching a waypoint, delay the execution of the next conditional "
"\"_DO_\" command for the specified number of seconds (e.g. "
":ref:`MAV_CMD_DO_SET_ROI <mav_cmd_do_set_roi>`)."
msgstr ""
"到达航点后，将下一条条件「_DO_」指令（例如 :ref:`MAV_CMD_DO_SET_ROI "
"<mav_cmd_do_set_roi>`）的执行延迟指定秒数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1359
#: c8a539fb96394cb2ac2f41bc3cfd9d34
msgid ""
"This command does not stop the vehicle. If the vehicle reaches the next "
"waypoint before the delay timer completes, the delayed \"_DO_\" commands "
"will never trigger."
msgstr "此指令不会停止飞行器。如果飞行器在延迟计时器完成前到达下一个航点，延迟的「_DO_」指令将永远不会触发。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1418
#: 29197a4945ac4e92a68471a3d5dbbd39
msgid "Mission Planner Settings for CONDITION_DELAY command"
msgstr "CONDITION_DELAY 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1420
#: 97c7d29f01cf4fc28dcb0e2f76b9391f
msgid ""
"In the example above, Command #4 (``DO_SET_ROI``) is delayed so that it "
"starts 5 seconds after the vehicle has passed Waypoint #2."
msgstr "在上述示例中，指令 #4（``DO_SET_ROI``）被延迟，使其在飞行器经过航点 #2 后 5 秒才开始执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1427
#: 2f7e3193d89c46f28450e54aa8e3a768
msgid "MAV_CMD_CONDITION_DISTANCE"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_CONDITION_DISTANCE"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1431
#: d44ac189d13b43878a07b0daef93a3c2
msgid ""
"Delays the start of the next \"``_DO_``\\ \" command until the vehicle is "
"within the specified number of meters of the next waypoint."
msgstr "延迟下一条「``_DO_``\\ 」指令的执行，直到飞行器距下一个航点在指定米数范围内。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1436
#: 9152262c7cd4492f810974c00b6832f8
msgid "This command does not stop the vehicle: it only affects DO commands."
msgstr "此指令不会停止飞行器：它只影响 DO 指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1493
#: 01cf11d32a0540f3b17684983ace8827
msgid "Mission PlannerSettings for CONDITION_DISTANCE command"
msgstr "CONDITION_DISTANCE 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1495
#: 3e30a1ad980a48ffb64cb08b37ef4153
msgid ""
"In the example above, Command #4 (``DO_SET_ROI``) is delayed so that it only"
" starts once the vehicle is within 50m of waypoint #5."
msgstr "在上述示例中，指令 #4（``DO_SET_ROI``）被延迟，使其仅在飞行器距航点 #5 50m 范围内时才开始执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1504
#: 2fa3c6e00c604beea3c976510240fba7
msgid "MAV_CMD_CONDITION_YAW"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_CONDITION_YAW"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1508
#: c60a6b1a5a7f41ca854a9b90d434973f
msgid "Point (yaw) the nose of the vehicle towards a specified heading."
msgstr "将飞行器机头（偏航）指向指定航向。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1510
#: 85f4a28aa435469f9d6ffc7838ddbf8c
msgid ""
"The parameters allow you to specify whether the target direction is absolute"
" or relative to the current yaw direction. If the direction is relative you "
"can also (separately) specify whether the value is added or subtracted from "
"the current heading (note that the vehicle will always turn in the direction"
" that most quickly gets it to the new target heading regardless of the "
"``param3`` value)."
msgstr ""
"参数允许您指定目标方向是绝对方向还是相对于当前偏航方向。如果方向是相对的，您还可以（单独地）指定该值是加到还是减去当前航向（注意飞行器始终会以最快的方式转向新目标航向，而不管"
" ``param3`` 的值）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1577
#: 6e254b728d8049b497c4c3f41a468e87
msgid "Copter: Mission Planner Settings for CONDITION_YAW command"
msgstr "Copter：CONDITION_YAW 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1583
#: b419b93dbecd41dab01506c24723967c
msgid "Special Commands"
msgstr "特殊指令"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1585
#: 6ead6d7ec3c24b76ad22bfb1b3371e91
msgid ""
"This section is for commands that may be relevant to missions, but which are"
" not mission commands (part of the mission)."
msgstr "本节介绍可能与任务相关，但不是任务指令（不是任务的一部分）的指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1591
#: 7a9327b68c1c4fc28be732758067c2f7
msgid "MAV_CMD_MISSION_START"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_MISSION_START"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1593
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1682
#: 5f27f628b23c4b9c9326c211bd3d0713 9f40d27afe3847f1b663dbb0a43de677
msgid "Supported by: Copter"
msgstr "支持的飞行器：Copter"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1595
#: f43cef9ef3714c4e9b3c53de559149e2
msgid ""
"This command can be used to start a mission when the Copter is on the ground"
" in AUTO mode. If the vehicle is already in the air then the mission will "
"start as soon as you switch into AUTO mode (so this command is not "
"needed/ignored). This allows a GCS/companion computer to start a mission in "
"AUTO without raising the throttle."
msgstr ""
"当 Copter 在地面处于 AUTO 模式时，此指令可用于启动任务。如果飞行器已在飞行中，切换到 AUTO "
"模式后任务将立即开始（因此此指令不需要/被忽略）。这允许地面站/伴飞计算机在不拉高油门的情况下以 AUTO 模式启动任务。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1603
#: a8143f7b81fe4811a194ba6b6b68d364
msgid ""
"Previously a mission would only start after the pilot engaged the throttle. "
"This command makes it possible to start missions without directly "
"controlling the throttle (though that approach is still available)."
msgstr "以前，任务只能在飞手操作油门后才能启动。此指令使得在不直接控制油门的情况下启动任务成为可能（尽管那种方式仍然可用）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1608
#: d7d5d424a2f7406c80763da133bc5b02
msgid ""
"This is not a \"mission command\" (it can't be used as a type of mission "
"waypoint). It is run from the **Action** menu (see the screenshot below)."
msgstr "这不是「任务指令」（不能作为任务航点类型使用）。它从 **动作** 菜单运行（见下方截图）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1614
#: e3aaff3fcac44bd89a8c8725972fc504
msgid "The parameters are all ignored."
msgstr "所有参数均被忽略。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1675
#: 8763434b6e3440e7b0aba4c1802e7733
msgid "Mission Planner: MISSION_START command"
msgstr "Mission Planner：MISSION_START 指令"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1680
#: 22818c7ecfea4741bcd6219de9de0cec
msgid "MAV_CMD_COMPONENT_ARM_DISARM"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_COMPONENT_ARM_DISARM"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1684
#: b56241158a284f5f8f8408ba2ceeea84
msgid "Disarm the motors."
msgstr "上锁电机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1686
#: 05cb51c7e0fe4b5981d3e2ed0d28b39c
msgid "The command supports disarming on the ground and in flight."
msgstr "该指令支持在地面和飞行中上锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1690
#: 4e7ae53d3bab4f438eb5bd9ecf41784e
msgid "The motors will disarm automatically after landing."
msgstr "降落后电机将自动上锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1692
#: 6822f9e50344488fbf4fed61fba25ed0
msgid ""
"This is not a \"mission command\" (it can't be used as a type of mission "
"waypoint)."
msgstr "这不是「任务指令」（不能作为任务航点类型使用）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1747
#: 4b9e3bdb94294a22ac58b17a5a827dd0
msgid "DO commands"
msgstr "DO 指令"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1749
#: 615978515a4448e1bb873e9bee6b7590
msgid ""
"The \"DO\" or \"Now\" commands are executed once to perform some action. All"
" the DO commands associated with a waypoint are executed immediately."
msgstr "「DO」或「立即」指令被执行一次以执行某个动作。与航点相关的所有 DO 指令立即执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1757
#: 25bc1d4a096a4cfb8738e3d15a770184
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_CHANGE_SPEED"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_CHANGE_SPEED"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1763
#: d8b96b45fe10488383aa93b29337f718
msgid ""
"Sets the desired maximum speed in meters/second (only). Both the speed-type "
"and throttle settings are ignored."
msgstr "仅设置期望最大速度（米/秒）。速度类型和油门设置均被忽略。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1820
#: 4c5ab157ce1f45149eb0de5c8064aefe
msgid "Copter: Mission Planner Settings for DO_CHANGE_SPEED command"
msgstr "Copter：DO_CHANGE_SPEED 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1831
#: c11dbade159a4e94acb2d06655984324
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_SET_HOME"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_SET_HOME"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1835
#: a8ade98cc08743108096ce035f77a04d
msgid ""
"Sets the home location either as the current location or at the location "
"specified in the command. For SITL work, altitude input here needs to be "
"with reference to absolute altitude, taking into account SRTM elevation."
msgstr "将 Home 位置设置为当前位置或指令中指定的位置。对于 SITL 工作，此处输入的高度需参考绝对高度，并考虑 SRTM 高程数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1840
#: e6fc6222b1084944bd2904b2a98af615
msgid ""
"For Plane and Rover, if a good GPS fix cannot be obtained the location "
"specified in the command is used."
msgstr "对于 Plane 和 Rover，如果无法获取良好的 GPS 定位，则使用指令中指定的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1842
#: 2436db2839c944e2a8fc2669f8185083
msgid ""
"For Copter, the command will also try to use the current position if all the"
" location parameters are set to 0. The location information in the command "
"is only used if it is close to the EKF origin."
msgstr "对于 Copter，如果所有位置参数均设置为 0，该指令也会尝试使用当前位置。指令中的位置信息仅在其接近 EKF 原点时使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1909
#: 6bd8ad6115a34218a40d8c67a9baf3cc
msgid "Mission Planner Settings for DO_SET_HOME command"
msgstr "DO_SET_HOME 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1914
#: 1649c55c565542cf944c15788203955f
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_SET_RELAY"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_SET_RELAY"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1918
#: 98f60871a6ae47818e8407a285956e40
msgid "Set a `Relay <common-relay>`__ pin's voltage high (on) or low (off)."
msgstr "将 `继电器 <common-relay>`__ 引脚电压设为高电平（开）或低电平（关）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1981
#: 6ddaedc6e5754023a94c7a27dce8d04b
msgid "MissionPlanner Settings for DO_SET_RELAY command"
msgstr "DO_SET_RELAY 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1986
#: 1dabfea573c444b0b262f3ca3ff8e4a2
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_REPEAT_RELAY"
